  "body": "### Summary\nCapture the per-category sub-forum lists from HFR's REST endpoint so that the forum list can show every sub-forum without guessing. Today R57a has the counts only.\n\nScope\n- GET `/api/forums/hardwarefr/categories/<id>/subcategories/` for categories 1 (Hardware), 2 (Overclocking…) and 10 (Programmation): read-only, logged out, then logged in if the answer differs.\n- Anonymize, add MANIFEST rows and settle the matching row in HFR-PROTOCOL.\n\nSources: R57a (counts: Programmation 27, Overclocking 7, Hardware 15); `SubforumInjection.swift`; legacy `ObjCForumsParser.m:111-503`; LOT-021 §Sub-forum injection.\n\nAcceptance criteria\n- Three captured lists, anonymized, in `captures/` with MANIFEST rows.\n- `check --corpus` is clean.\n",
